		},
		{
			"id": "ApO_wuFkZZ94hGnln",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "AuTvxWWK8OOulT-DJ",
			"text": "Dust Plume: Once per hour, a dust mephit can surround himself with a plume of dust. This reaches to a two-yard radius around the mephit. With care, it can include a few friends as well. Subtract 4 from any attempts to see the mephit using normal vision; there is no resistance roll. Even if someone does manage to see the mephit, subtract 4 from any attack roll against him that relies on vision to hit. The mephit itself can see perfectly while using this ability. The boundaries of the zone are easily detected by vision, however; roll at +4. The mephit activates this ability by taking a Concentrate maneuver. Each activation lasts for 1 minute."
		},
		{
			"id": "ALd5nhbWM1YshpifU",
